{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o183a","title":"呼厨泉来朝留魏，去卑监国","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o183a-account","label":"正文","text":"呼厨泉率名王来朝，以客礼接待并留魏，去卑受命监其国。","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]},{"id":"wuhuan-a-da4d15b9a252fbe0f35c","label":"正文","text":"呼厨泉南单于入朝，遂留内侍，右贤王受命代抚其国","evidence":["wuhuan-q-5da8a1d250f1cd3d8952"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0357","role":"来朝留魏","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0358","role":"监国","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"接待任命","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安二十一年秋七月","year":216,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q","wudi-q-o181","wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681"],"chronology":"wudi-y216","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o181","basis":"建安二十一年秋七月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1036,"O183a"],"order":391},{"id":"wendi-e-o016b","title":"更授呼厨泉魏玺绶","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o016b-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"更授呼厨泉魏玺绶","evidence":["wendi-e-o016b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0357","role":"受玺绶","evidence":["wendi-e-o016b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"黄初元年十一月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"黄初元年十一月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o016b-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o016b-q","source_order":[2,184,"O016b"],"order":558}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0357","name":"呼厨泉","evidence":["wudi-q-o183","wendi-q-o016","wuhuan-q-5da8a1d250f1cd3d8952"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o183-wudi-p0357","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o183"]},{"id":"wendi-m-o016-wudi-p0357","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o016"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o016b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-49e65a0ade4817b85529","layer":"original","quote":"更授匈奴南单于呼厨泉魏玺绶，赐青盖车、乘舆、宝剑、玉玦〖14〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":65,"end":97},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o016","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-49e65a0ade4817b85529","layer":"original","quote":"改相国为司徒，御史大夫为司空，奉常为太常〖11〗，郎中令为光禄勋〖12〗，大理为廷尉，大农为大司农〖13〗。郡国、县邑，多所改易。更授匈奴南单于呼厨泉魏玺绶，赐青盖车、乘舆、宝剑、玉玦〖14〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"wudi-e-o183a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-83f7b9d702d089d8a771","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，匈奴南单于呼厨泉，将其名王来朝。待以客礼，遂留魏。使右贤王去卑监其国〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十一年：建安二十一年（公元 216）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6fbf1801762e86de3cad","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"wudi-q-o181","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-13ff126a9ae1c811de3d","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年春二月〖1〗，公还邺。﹝一﹞三月壬寅〖2〗，公亲耕籍田。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35},{"id":"wudi-q-o183","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-83f7b9d702d089d8a771","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，匈奴南单于呼厨泉，将其名王来朝。待以客礼，遂留魏。使右贤王去卑监其国〖5〗。八月，以大理钟繇为相国〖6〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60},{"id":"wuhuan-q-5da8a1d250f1cd3d8952","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-b00cc970e1a8caac9059","layer":"original","quote":"建安中，呼厨泉南单于入朝，遂留内侍，使右贤王抚其国","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
